66 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 182 0 R
/E (The Christian Life Community \(CLC\) is a worldwide lay association within the Catholic Church, with communities in more than 60 countries. Rooted in the spirituality of St Ignatius and his invitation to "find God in all things," CLC encourages members to discover God's presence in the ordinary experiences of daily life through prayer, reflection, and community.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
