<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 231 0 R
/E (On 29th June 2006 together with thirteen other men from the Archdiocese of Perth, I was ordained as a permanent deacon. Now twenty years later and appointed as the deacon for St Thomas the Apostle Parish, I would like to share some insights into the ministry.)
